NAME         HQ_MAP

DESCRIPTION 'Advanced Heroquest Map Generator'

CODE         PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA         PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE

EXETYPE      WINDOWS

HEAPSIZE     4096
STACKSIZE    20000

IMPORTS
             KERNEL32.GetLastError
             KERNEL32.GetProcAddress
             KERNEL32.LoadLibraryA
             KERNEL32.OutputDebugStringA
             KERNEL32.RtlUnwind
